AB  - Based on requirements and analysis of actuality digital measurement and control system in grain situation, a full digital measure and control scheme based on Browser/Server (B/S) communications model is presented, which is adopted CAN and 1-Wire in field of grain storage. The paper analyses network running configuration and system configuration At the same time, it introduces main communication protocol and studies system configuration module. This system implements real-time measure and control grain situation by long-distance. The characteristics of the system has high reliability, and easy to extend Based on distributed test and applications of several grain depots directly under center, the system is dependability and prone to be extended, and furthermore, this system is very promising and valuable.
